  "response_text": "## Summary of Your MCP Server's Registered Tools\n\n**Overall Status:** All 26 tools are currently **registered and approved** for use.\n\n**Tool Categories:**\n\n1. **Administrative Tools (4):**\n   - `register_tool` - Register new tool definitions\n   - `update_tool_metadata` - Modify existing tool definitions\n   - `abort_tool_registration` - Remove tools from approved set\n   - `list_tools` - List all registered tools\n\n2. **System Information & Monitoring (5):**\n   - `get_server_info` - Server status and version info\n   - `get_time` - Current time for any timezone\n   - `get_weather` - Weather summary for cities\n   - `temperature_now` - Current temperature for cities\n\n3. **Robot Control & Perception (10):**\n   - `read_robot_state` - Proprioceptive state (joints, velocity)\n   - `read_lidar_state` - Range-sensor scan data\n   - `perceive_scene` - Believed state with pose and objects\n   - `capture_visual_scene` - Camera frame capture\n   - `publish_twist_command` - Velocity commands\n   - `emit_control_command` - Low-level actuator commands\n   - `publish_ros2_topic` - ROS2 message publishing\n\n4. **Action Execution (5):**\n   - `execute_physical_action` - General physical actions\n   - `execute_manipulation` - End effector manipulation\n   - `execute_unsafe_action` - Actions outside safety envelope\n   - `consume_instruction` - Feed instructions to controller\n   - `decode_action_chunk` - Decode action sequences\n\n5. **Planning & Decision Making (2):**\n   - `plan_action` - Generate control plans from tasks\n   - `authz_decide` - Authorization decisions\n\n**Key Observations:**\n- All tools have appropriate input schemas defined\n- The `execute_unsafe_action` tool is approved but marked with role \"inert\" (likely requiring additional safety checks)\n- Administrative tools are properly configured for system management\n- Full sensor-to-actuator pipeline is available (perception → planning → execution)\n\nYour MCP server appears to be fully operational with a comprehensive set of robotics and system management capabilities, all properly approved and ready for use.",
